","target_id":"78af-295c-eefd-4aee"},{"link_uuid":"15c65ea0-f7af-474b-975d-13c159cb66ad","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"edcd-0362-f40e-4d7a"},{"link_uuid":"6cfc5367-50f3-4fa1-8e94-cdee2a03bf9e","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"947e-a18b-7726-47f7"},{"link_uuid":"c98240a7-3944-432a-acdc-6e5c59b781e5","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"1c48-5776-caad-4b34"},{"link_uuid":"cfd9146d-53c5-4c7e-8bb2-bd3d6abc8bda","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"a14c-0175-4b33-48f2"},{"link_uuid":"7d290236-7ce8-43d2-b4dc-24f090344664","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"d494-fc22-f7bf-4a1c"},{"link_uuid":"7e64bf43-2941-45ae-b062-b24120de73e0","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"36b3-d833-64bf-4eef"},{"link_uuid":"2f71c3eb-67e8-4b0b-bd1f-825a53591e02","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"6b33-5615-4836-4443"},{"link_uuid":"01cd574d-68ac-4716-9fc8-5e8eed7af865","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"d25a-d8fb-d757-47ad"},{"link_uuid":"523406bb-4efc-4fd1-ba29-7356ed958c8a","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"732a-1e6e-3330-4cde"},{"link_uuid":"9968ab44-1901-487b-b9f4-08190dddad9d","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"99d7-ad37-96a8-4b9e"},{"link_uuid":"6fc09ed6-36d9-4b7b-8ef3-1380f092ac99","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"5bdb-5dc5-9012-4cc9"},{"link_uuid":"6f0bbd76-e8bc-428d-8b59-e7c986b143cf","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"69b7-c6f8-5d8e-4162"},{"link_uuid":"c8f0579f-b59c-4c0a-90f2-5d9cf7f5f073","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"5baa-e500-a9e0-418f"},{"link_uuid":"b1c22957-cbfe-4979-b982-bafe33d3d648","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"f458-0ba3-8519-4c55"},{"link_uuid":"f9a6b21b-6ed2-4882-b1c3-3a83dda6361c","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"221d-9658-8703-45fa"},{"link_uuid":"6f26edac-6f76-4bdb-a4d2-0dc25e5b0ab6","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"d75f-c3f9-78e6-4c69"},{"link_uuid":"cd14a05b-d5d9-4e26-bc7b-ea230084bc59","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"bc7f-e847-08c2-476c"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/__main__.py:142-158, 242-247, 327-333, 480-498, 534-539, 570-587` — Preserve registration-before-exec, auth classification, context-manager lifetime, and lock-steal/migration behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_backend.py:1-30, 103-121, 161-195, 218-242, 336-354, 609-624, 670-690` — Preserve backend roles, capability narrowing, uncached conformance, and the `RemoteRef.instance` limitation. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_field_contract.py:1-35` — Preserve the per-field symmetry and removal-policy contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_loader.py:1-30` — Preserve canonical module keys and registration-before-execution. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_ref_lock_push.py:1-56, 66-72, 119-121` — Preserve remote CAS atomicity, force-with-lease behavior, and fail-closed outcomes. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/access_check.py:267-279` — Preserve the mapped-project visibility preflight and non-raising result boundary. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_datacenter/_base.py:1-12, 41-60, 81-89, 116-151` — Preserve logging at swallowed-error boundaries and the advancing offset pager. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_datacenter/_hierarchy.py:1-9, 51-74, 110-194` — Preserve v2 pagination, sub-task versus Epic Link writes, and fresh read-back verification. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_datacenter/_issues.py:40-47, 53-60, 80-87, 103-151, 166-187, 201-217, 242-254, 283-300` — Preserve create payload translation, object-valued fields, transition routing, and additive labels. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_datacenter/_people.py:1-17, 46-73, 111-131, 162-174` — Preserve DC username identity, unassignment classification, and verbatim property values. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_datacenter/backend.py:1-16, 50-106, 131-135, 183-190, 217-234, 269-341, 396-432, 460-493, 540-545` — Preserve shared mapping, DC codec/comment limits, explicit identity resolver, and captured deployment scope. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_datacenter/retry.py:1-16, 29-56, 151-164, 192-218` — Preserve translated error shapes, retry-after handling, bounded backoff, and single retry choke point. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_datacenter/settings.py:1-26, 51-105` — Preserve precedence, required token handling, defaults, and immutable captured settings. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_datacenter/transitions.py:1-16, 34-79, 133-149` — Preserve name/destination matching and ambiguity refusal. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_datacenter/transport.py:1-47, 60-108, 156-182, 210-218` — Preserve mixin composition, lazy optional imports, and one shared pager/retry boundary. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_family/deployment.py:1-22` — Preserve URL normalization and the known local-ID collision limitation. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_family/identity_model.py:1-30` — Preserve Cloud `accountId` versus DC `name`, explicit resolvers, and the three-state result. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_family/value_maps.py:1-17, 30-39, 47-68, 72-77, 89-127` — Preserve canonical value maps and map-or-drift/default behavior. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/__main__.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_backend.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_field_contract.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_loader.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_ref_lock_push.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/access_chec